sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Utilisateur
  participant A as Application
  participant I as IdP (OIDC)
  participant T as Token endpoint

  U->>A: Accès ressource
  A->>I: Redirect /authorize (Auth Code + PKCE)
  I->>U: Auth (MFA/Passkey)
  I-->>A: Redirect avec code
  A->>T: Échange code -> tokens (PKCE)
  T-->>A: ID token + access token (+ refresh token)
  A-->>U: Session applicative
